# Release checklist — <application version>

- [ ] Change IDs, owner reports and scope are complete
- [ ] Only affected artifacts planned for deployment where architecture permits
- [ ] Contract/dependency compatibility checked
- [ ] Company/role security review performed when applicable
- [ ] Database migration versioned and populated-data upgrade-tested when applicable
- [ ] Backup/restore validated when upgrade risk requires it
- [ ] Automated build and tests run with evidence
- [ ] QA acceptance, regression and negative tests recorded
- [ ] Release notes and documentation updated
- [ ] Roll-forward/rollback and known irreversible limitations documented
- [ ] Human production authorization recorded if deploying
- [ ] Deployment runbook and smoke/health tests prepared
- [ ] Post-release verification observed and reported

